OL,17,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,18,     GDonald Macleod sees Franz Xaver
OL,19,     GMozart leave Vienna to take up
OL,20,     Gwork in Galicia, signalling a
OL,21,     Gcreative explosion in new works.
